<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">About </ansi><ansi fg="command">GeOMUD</ansi>

<ansi fg="command">GeOMUD</ansi> is a Diku-style <ansi fg="229">MUD</ansi> engine for worlds built on real geography. Rooms
are generated from map data on a uniform grid, for worlds from one small
island up to a whole planet, and hand-built areas override generated ones.

<ansi fg="command">GeOMUD</ansi> is early in development. This server runs the bare engine.

