<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Origins</ansi>

<ansi fg="command">GeOMUD</ansi> is a hard fork of <ansi fg="command">GoMud</ansi>, the open source <ansi fg="229">MUD</ansi> engine written in <ansi fg="command">Go</ansi> by
<ansi fg="14">Dylan Squires</ansi> (aka <ansi fg="11">Volte6</ansi>) and contributors. The fork was taken in <ansi fg="red">October
2026</ansi> under the MIT license. <ansi fg="command">GeOMUD</ansi> is an independent project, so please don't
report <ansi fg="command">GeOMUD</ansi> issues to <ansi fg="command">GoMud</ansi>.

<ansi fg="black-bold">Find out more (or get the code):</ansi> <ansi fg="51">github.com/pruuk/GeOMUD</ansi>
